{"ref":"BDB, מֵישָׁר","hw":"מֵישָׁר","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מֵישָׁר</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. evenness, uprightness, equity</strong>;—only pl.: <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵשָׁרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.3\">Pr 1:3</a>; elsewhere <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵישָׁרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.7\">Is 26:7</a> + 17 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>evenness, level</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.7\">Is 26:7</a>, of path of righteous (in the future), fig. for free from difficulties; <em>smoothness</em>, of the flow of wine, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:31\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.31\">Pr 23:31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">למ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:10\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.10\">Ct 7:10</a>;<br><strong>2.</strong>  in ethical sense, <em>uprightness, equity</em>, as taught in the school of wisdom <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.6\">Pr 8:6</a>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶדֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.3\">1:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.9\">2:9</a>; of government <span dir=\"rtl\">(ב)מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:9\" href=\"/Psalms.9.9\">ψ 9:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:2\" href=\"/Psalms.58.2\">58:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:3\" href=\"/Psalms.75.3\">75:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 96:10\" href=\"/Psalms.96.10\">96:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 98:9\" href=\"/Psalms.98.9\">98:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 99:4\" href=\"/Psalms.99.4\">99:4</a>; of speech <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.15\">Is 33:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.16\">Pr 23:16</a>; of Yahweh’s promises <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.19\">Is 45:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רצה מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.17\">1 Ch 29:17</a> <em>have pleasure in equity;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עשׂה מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:6\" href=\"/Daniel.11.6\">Dn 11:6</a> <em>make an equitable arrangement</em>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  adv. <em>rightly</em>, with <span dir=\"rtl\">חזה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:2\" href=\"/Psalms.17.2\">ψ 17:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אהב</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.4\">Ct 1:4</a>.","next":"BDB, מִישׁוֹר","prev":"BDB, יְשֻׁרוּן"}